      ],
      "content": "QUEENSWAY 1. 5252                                                   (North Side)                                                   Nos 27 and 29 TL 0507 1/66 II                       G7 2. Early Cl9.  Yellow brick with flush red brick quoins, Welsh slated roof.  3 storeys, red brick eaves courses.  2 sash windows with glazing bars, lst floor segmentally arched panels, round windows.  Modern shop front.  Cl6 wing on right has carriageway, plaster faced timber framed lst floor with glazing bars to sash window, gable to old tiled roof. Nos 23 to 29 (odd) and Nos 16 and 18 High Street, form a group. Listing NGR: TL0553907673"
    }
